    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG is delighted to present number 1 Monaloe Court to the market, a bright and well-presented two-bedroom home nestled in a private and peaceful cul-de-sac just off the Bray Road. Spanning approximately 60 sqm, the well laid-out accommodation features a bright kitchen overlooking a low-maintenance, south-facing rear garden, a spacious living room, two double bedrooms, and a family bathroom. Positioned at the end of the terrace, this home benefits from a generously sized garden offering a superb opportunity for future development (subject to relevant planning permissions), alongside convenient side passage access and off-street car parking to the front.\n\nThe standout feature of this property is its unbeatable location, offering unparalleled convenience for daily life. Residents will enjoy being literally adjacent to many bus routes along the N11 QBC, providing effortless commuting options right on your doorstep, while also remaining within easy access of the Luas at Carrickmines and the M50 motorway. Furthermore, everyday shopping and leisure could not be simpler, with the property situated just a short stroll from the premier Dunnes Stores at Cornelscourt and the sprawling, beautiful grounds of Cabinteely Park.\n\nIn addition to these prime amenities, the property sits within walking distance of the charming village of Cabinteely, putting excellent local shops, eateries, pubs, and restaurants right at your doorstep. Outstanding recreational options abound with both Cabinteely Park and Kilbogget Park nearby, offering fantastic sporting, social, and cultural activities, while Dundrum Town Centre and Carrickmines Retail Park are both just a short drive away. Perfect for families, the home is also within close proximity to some of South Dublin's most popular primary and secondary schools, all easily accessible via the N11, making 1 Monaloe Court the perfect blend of peaceful cul-de-sac living and ultimate urban convenience."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nLiving Room - 5.22m x 3.73m\n\n\nKitchen - 2.53m x 3.73m\n\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.62m x 3.73m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.55m x 3.73m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.45m x 2.68m\n\n\n"
